    "https://www.dewv.edu/career/server-waitstaff-graceland-inn-restaurant/": {
      "title": "Server / Waitstaff",
      "description": "Server / Waitstaff - Graceland Inn & Restaurant - Davis & Elkins College Press Option+1 for screen-reader mode, Option+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window Skip to the content Davis & Elkins College Search: Search Search Academics Academics Overview Calendar Majors & Programs Pre-Professional Studies Course Catalog Directory Educational Support Booth Library Career Services Life at D&E Life at D&E Overview Residential Life Dining Services Health & Safety Morrison-Novakovic Center for Faith and Public Policy Clubs & Organizations Bookstore Admissions Admission Overview Apply Request Info Contact Us Tuition & Aid Tuition & Aid Overview Tuition Costs Financial Aid Scholarships Athletics Calendar About D&E About D&E Overview Office of the President Leadership Mission, Vision & History Directory Campus Map Explore Elkins Ministry Connections Work at D&E The Senator Daily My D&E Alumni Give Back Graduates of the Last Decade (GOLD) Administrative Requests Calendar Merch & Perks Alumni Association Board Spotlight Stories Chapters Forward Magazine Current Students Self-Service Portal Forms, Tools & Resources Student Billing Registrar Course Catalog Bookstore Booth Library Career Services Commencement New & Prospective Students Enroll Visit Virtual Tour Tuition & Aid International Students Transfer Students Important Forms For Parents & Families Faculty/Staff Self-Service Portal Informer Visit Give Request Info Info Apply Home > Server / Waitstaff – Graceland Inn […] Server / Waitstaff – Graceland Inn & Restaurant Pay Range: $10.75-$12.25 per hour, depending on experience Status: Part-Time / Hourly, Non-Exempt The Server/Waitstaff provides exceptional dining experiences by welcoming guests, taking accurate food and beverage orders, and delivering attentive, timely service. This role ensures guests feel well cared for in an upscale dining environment while maintaining high standards of professionalism, hospitality, and knowledge of the menu . Responsibilities Greet guests promptly and warmly upon arrival. Present menus, explain specials, and answer questions about food, beverages, and wine pairings. Take accurate orders and enter them into the POS system efficiently. Serve food and beverages with attention to detail and proper service steps. Monitor guest satisfaction throughout the dining experience and anticipate needs. Clear and reset tables following restaurant standards. Handle payments accurately and process transactions securely. Work with kitchen and bar staff to ensure smooth service flow. Maintain cleanliness and organization of service areas. Follow all safety, sanitation, and hospitality guidelines. Knowledge/Skills/Abilities High school diploma or equivalent required Prior serving experience preferred Qualifications To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each essential duty satisfactorily. The requirements listed below are representative of the knowledge, skill, and/or ability required. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. ServeSafe certification obtained within six months of employment. Additional certifications required by federal, state and/or local regulations. Ability to multi-task. Ability to communicate effectively. Physical Demands The physical demands described here are representative of those that must be met by an employee to successfully perform the essential functions of this job. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. Standing and or walking-100% of the time Occasionally lifting up to 251bs.; Frequently lifting up to 101bs. Apply Today! 100 Campus Drive, Elkins, W.Va. 26241 304-637-1900 100 Campus Drive Elkins, W.Va. 26241 304-637-1900 Contact Us Instagram Tik Tok X YouTube Flickr Facebook LinkedIn Upcoming  Events Full Calendar 11/7 Admission Open House 8