      "title": "Utility Worker",
      "description": "Utility Worker - Dining Services - Davis & Elkins College Press Option+1 for screen-reader mode, Option+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window Skip to the content Davis & Elkins College Search: Search Search Academics Academics Overview Calendar Majors & Programs Pre-Professional Studies Course Catalog Directory Educational Support Booth Library Career Services Life at D&E Life at D&E Overview Residential Life Dining Services Health & Safety Morrison-Novakovic Center for Faith and Public Policy Clubs & Organizations Bookstore Admissions Admission Overview Apply Request Info Contact Us Tuition & Aid Tuition & Aid Overview Tuition Costs Financial Aid Scholarships Athletics Calendar About D&E About D&E Overview Office of the President Leadership Mission, Vision & History Directory Campus Map Explore Elkins Ministry Connections Work at D&E The Senator Daily My D&E Alumni Give Back Graduates of the Last Decade (GOLD) Administrative Requests Calendar Merch & Perks Alumni Association Board Spotlight Stories Chapters Forward Magazine Current Students Self-Service Portal Forms, Tools & Resources Student Billing Registrar Course Catalog Bookstore Booth Library Career Services Commencement New & Prospective Students Enroll Visit Virtual Tour Tuition & Aid International Students Transfer Students Important Forms For Parents & Families Faculty/Staff Self-Service Portal Informer Visit Give Request Info Info Apply Home > Utility Worker – Dining Services Utility Worker – Dining Services Pay Range: $10.75 – $12.25, depending on experience Status: Full-Time or Part-Time / Hourly, Non-Exempt Responsible for thoroughly cleaning all dishes, silverware, and other items under strict sanitary conditions . Responsibilities This is an overview of essential duties a more comprehensive list of expectations and responsibilities will be provided at interview Run dishes and silverware through dish machine following proper procedures. Clean and maintain certain equipment and areas as designated by management. Keep dish room clean at all times. Keep sufficient supply of China, silverware, trays, cups, and glasses in appropriate locations during service periods.  Restock fully between meal periods. Clean dish machine after each meal. Sweep and mop dish room floor at the end of each shift, and empty mop bucket. De-lime the dish machine once a week. Soak and scrub-stained cups weekly. Exercise extreme caution and carefully follow instructions and procedures when using chemicals. Follow cleaning schedule and using “clean as you go” techniques. Maintain an open line of communication with management, informing them of products and supplies needed. Follow the uniform dress code and maintain proper personal hygiene. Assist fellow associates at every opportunity. Responsible for other duties as assigned by management. Qualifications To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to perform each essential duty satisfactorily. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. The requirements listed below are representative of the knowledge, skill, and/or ability required . Previous kitchen experience preferred, but not required Physical Demands The physical demands described here are representative of those that must be met by an employee to successfully perform the essential functions of this position. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. Standing and/or walking 100% of the time Occasionally lifting up to 501bs. Frequently lifting up to 301bs. Apply Today! 100 Campus Drive, Elkins, W.Va. 26241 304-637-1900 100 Campus Drive Elkins, W.Va. 26241 304-637-1900 Contact Us Instagram Tik Tok X YouTube Flickr Facebook LinkedIn Upcoming  Events Full Calendar 11/7 Admission Open House 8 am.–1 pm. Myles Center for the Arts Myles Center for the Arts 11/11 Veterans Day All day 11/12 Capstone Day All day 11/23 Thanksgiving Break (No Classes) All day Full Calendar Explore D&E Campus Map Booth Library Flynn Planetarium Graceland Inn Bookstore Employment Contact Us Tools & Resources My D&E Portal Transcript Request Password Reset eMarketplace Media Kit Directory Compliance & Administration Consumer Information Title IX & Discrimination and Harassment ©2026 Davis & Elkins College  |  All Rights Reserved Explore D&E Search: Search We are offline - Send us an email AI Sorry, we are not online at the moment. Leave a message and we will get back to you. I agree that my personal data, provided via chat, to be processed for using live chat service by onWebChat Please give us some info to serve you better. I agree that my personal data, provided via chat, to be processed for using live chat service by onWebChat We are online - chat with us! 12:01 by onWebChat × File size larger than 50 Mb × File type not allowed × File could not be sent Send chat transcript to your email: × Transcript sent! Are you sure you want to end this chat? Thank you. We would appreciate it if you could rate this chat ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ No, thanks I agree that my personal data, provided via chat, to be processed for using live chat service Sound End chat"
